	"data": "Goal: Room 2.0 Convergence\n\nSpatial anchors mapping thought bubbles to physical locations. Walk up to a device, see its context.\n\nWhat This Is\nThe bridge between digital thought space and physical space. Thought bubbles anchored to real-world objects and locations — the Room 2.0 vision meeting ThoughtBubbles.\n\nSpecific Behaviors Needed\nPhysical anchoring — pin a thought bubble to a real-world position (e.g., above Star's monitor)\nPersistence — anchored bubbles survive between sessions (spatial…",
